{"id":"1bf3bbfe2d31746f","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-no-finite-code-conversion.md","title":"有限集特征索引不能统一转成完整成员代码","display":"thm-no-finite-code-conversion — 有限集特征索引不能统一转成完整成员代码","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-no-finite-code-conversion","aliases":["20-thm-no-finite-code-conversion"],"display":"thm-no-finite-code-conversion — 有限集特征索引不能统一转成完整成员代码","chapter":"2","section":"2.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.3.7","source_printed_pages":[35],"source_pdf_pages":[71],"depends_on":["[[20-df-characteristic-indices]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-thm-recursion]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-no-finite-code-conversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-no-finite-code-conversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-no-finite-code-conversion — 有限集特征索引不能统一转成完整成员代码"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.3.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>35</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>71</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3850151d9f29cbf4\" href=\"?note=3850151d9f29cbf4\" title=\"20-df-characteristic-indices\">20-df-characteristic-indices</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathcal C_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3850151d9f29cbf4\" href=\"?note=3850151d9f29cbf4\" title=\"20-df-characteristic-indices\">20-df-characteristic-indices</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}no\\text{-}finite\\text{-}code\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\neg\\forall F,i\\ [|F|&lt;\\omega\\land\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,F)\\Rightarrow\\exists d\\ (\\theta(i)\\downarrow=d\\land D_d=F)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}no\\text{-}finite\\text{-}code\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\neg\\forall F,i\\ [|F|&lt;\\omega\\land\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,F)\\Rightarrow\\exists d\\ (\\theta(i)\\downarrow=d\\land D_d=F)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给自索引 n 定义全二值函数：输入 x 时有界模拟 θ(n) 至阶段 x；尚未停止则输出 0；若它首次于阶段 s 停止输出 d，令 z&gt;max(D_d∪{s})，输出 1 恰在 x=z。该过程始终停止；若 θ(n) 永不停止，它是空集特征函数，按 promise 又必须停止。若停止，它是单点 {z} 的特征函数，但 z∉D_d，矛盾。固定 z&gt;s 保证早期返回的 0 不会与后来定义冲突。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.3.7；印刷页 35；PDF 第 71 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-characteristic-indices","status":"resolved","id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic-indices]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic-indices","status":"resolved","id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic-indices]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"2